  "description": "Official .NET SDK for the Payment Aggregator Central API. Integrate once and route payments through Stripe, PayPal, Razorpay, PayU, Cashfree, PayTabs, Telr, Mollie, Checkout.com, Adyen, Square, Worldpay, Braintree, Authorize.Net, 2Checkout, PayFast, Payoneer, PayStack, Flutterwave, Klarna, Afterpay, Paytm, PhonePe, Google Pay, Apple Pay, Amazon Pay, Midtrans, Xendit, Omise, HitPay, iPay88, eWAY, Bambora, and more. Create payment intents, confirm and capture payments, issue refunds, manage merchant stores, list transactions, rotate API keys, and validate signed webhooks — all via a single unified API. Supports ASP.NET Core dependency injection, IHttpClientFactory, retry policies, and both hosted and self-hosted deployments.",
